WEBVTT

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.900
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.630
Don't freely enter GeGeGe Forest.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:25.550
Are you a OoTuber, mister?

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.510
Can I eat him?

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:28.720
I'm against it.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.170
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:15.410
Is anyone there?

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:18.330
Please! Is anyone there?!

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:45.550
CHAPTER 4

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:50.530
THE TABOO OF THE MYSTERIOUS FOREST

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.570
Oh, Mana-chan!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.490
Yuta-kun!

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:01.980
So, did you meet Kitaro?

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:03.690
Yeah, I did!

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:06.960
Kitaro's father is called
Daddy Eyeball-san, and...

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:11.690
The worlds of <i>yokai</i> and humans don't mix.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.930
They shouldn't mix.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.010
Sorry, but--

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:20.330
I knew it. I knew Kitaro existed!

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:24.080
It's like my grandma said.
<i>Yokai</i> really exist!

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.770
Uh... Yuta-kun?

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:31.570
Sorry, but, I'm not really supposed to
tell people about Kitaro.

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.200
Huh, why?

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:37.410
Kitaro said that humans and <i>yokai</i>
shouldn't mix and...

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.800
So, Kitaro lives here?

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.970
He doesn't live here.

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:56.120
GeGeGe Forest, where Kitaro
and the others are, is connected to here.

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.410
But, it sounds like
humans can't enter GeGeGe Forest.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:01.640
Even I've never been there.

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:04.770
Humans can't go in? Oh wow!

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.150
Is it here?

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:07.520
How about here?

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.850
I told you, humans can't enter.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:13.660
Oh, a tunnel!

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.520
Mana-chan, look!

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:18.490
Do you think it's connected to
GeGeGe Forest?

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.930
What?

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.690
Maybe.

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:27.960
Hooray, I can meet Kitaro!

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.070
Wow!

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:32.580
-It goes on forever!
-"Mom, I bought the potato chips..."

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:37.180
Huh? Yuta-kun?

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.200
Huh?!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.690
Yuta-kun?

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.380
Where did you go? Yuta-kun!

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:48.950
Yuta-kun!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:20.460
Is this... GeGeGe Forest?

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:27.470
Huh? Where'd the tunnel go?

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.600
Huh?

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.110
Where'd you come from, kid?

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:35.860
Wh-Who're you?!

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.970
"Who're you" is a bit rude.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:42.330
I'm the BiBiBi no Rat Man-sama.
I'm really famous.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:44.390
Are you a OoTuber, mister?

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:46.270
No, I'm nothing like that.

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:47.480
Then I don't know you.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:49.830
Honestly...!

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:53.150
I'm sure you're just some kid
who wandered here from the human world.

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:54.800
Go on. Go home.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.760
Huh? Then this really is GeGeGe Forest?!

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.430
That's right. It's my forest.

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:02.950
Then, are you a <i>yokai</i>, mister?!

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:08.600
A <i>yokai</i>? I'm beyond a <i>yokai</i>.
I'm half-human, half-<i>yokai</i>.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:12.680
What's the commotion about, Rat Man?

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:26.160
Are you Kitaro-san?!

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:27.770
Kitaro-san!

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:31.420
I've wanted to meet you!
I can't believe you really exist!

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.960
Who are you?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.580
Daddy Eyeball-san?!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:41.110
You're really...

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:43.680
-You're really real!
-Hey, that tickles!

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:46.430
It's just like Mana-chan said!

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:48.980
Hold it.

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.810
By Mana-chan, you mean...

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.570
Yeah! My neighbors,
the Inuyama's daughter...

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:56.510
-Tee hee!
-Mana-chan!

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:57.530
Why that little...

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:01.760
Tell me, Kitaro-san,
this is GeGeGe Forest, right?

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:04.030
There are lots of <i>yokai</i>, right?

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:07.540
Don't freely enter GeGeGe Forest.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:22.010
How many centuries has it been
since a human wandered in here?

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:25.870
I think the last one was named, Torakichi.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:30.100
A boy again?
It'd be better if it was a girl.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:34.130
You really like women,
don't you, Rollo Cloth-san?

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.360
Wh-What're ya sayin'?

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.090
-Of course I do!
-Want me to kiss you?

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.460
Why are you laughing so carefreely?

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:42.010
A human entering GeGeGe Forest?

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.410
I'm against it.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:46.930
That's right.
There's no money in it anyways.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.410
Just kick him out.

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.540
Oh? We're actually seeing
eye to eye for once.

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:54.100
Um, you're Catchick-san, right?

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:54.920
So?

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.670
You're just like Mana-chan said...

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:04.390
"Catchick-san is super strong, yet she's
graceful and pretty and really cool."

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:07.050
Mana-chan said so!

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:10.330
-You know Mana?
-Yes!

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:13.460
Well, you've met everyone. Satisfied?

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.000
Now go home.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.710
Don't be so harsh, Kitaro.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.400
It must be fate that he came here.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.380
Sand Witch-san...!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:27.470
Hold on. Why was a human child
able to enter GeGeGe Forest?

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:31.500
The souls of human children aren't stable.

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:34.920
It's like they're between
humans and <i>yokai</i>.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.560
Child, what's your name?

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:38.630
It's Yuta.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:42.380
Yuta-kun, you believe in
things you can't see, don't you?

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:45.510
Yeah. My grandma told me about everything.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:49.030
About Kitaro-san and the other <i>yokai</i>.

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.140
I see. Your grandmother.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:55.000
I'm the one who suggested
we put a letter in the Yokai Mailbox.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.310
Because Grandma told me about it.

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:59.210
I see, I see.

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:02.690
As Sand Witch says,
a meeting by chance is preordained.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:05.880
Kitaro, show him the forest.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:06.910
Huh?

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.240
Yes, Dad.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:13.950
I'll show you around, so follow me.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.770
But, don't go touching anything
in the forest.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:18.540
Okay!

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:22.920
Traitor.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:26.680
-N-N-Nothing.
-Yikes!

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:32.640
This is GeGeGe Forest.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.500
That's the Eternal Tree.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.750
Beyond it are the Yokai Hot Springs.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:41.210
Over there is the Medama Chasm.
Next to that is the Yashaga Waterfall.

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:42.590
Oh wow!

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:44.720
Hey, don't just run off.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:49.340
It can't be helped.
Human children are balls of curiosity.

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:51.430
That's not a bad thing.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.530
Sure, sure.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.930
Oh, Kitaro.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:01.480
He won't hurt you. He's a gentle <i>yokai</i>.

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.280
He's very wise.

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:08.650
A human child. How rare.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:13.360
You're Abura-Sumashi-san, aren't you?!
My grandma told me who you were!

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:16.060
I'm still here.

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:18.370
Kitaro, want to play some <i>shogi</i>?

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.290
Maybe next time.

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:48.570
Catchick-san...

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:51.030
It's fine. It's just Betobeto-san.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:52.760
Betobeto-san?

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:54.990
Grandma told me stories!

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:59.330
Your grandma knows a lot,
doesn't she, Yuta?

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.430
Yeah!

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:05.200
Let's see... I'm supposed to go to
the side of the road and...

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:12.170
Betobeto-san, go ahead.

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:34.130
It's just like Grandma said!

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:39.350
Say, Kitaro-san,
do you think <i>yokai</i> like humans?

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:42.480
Some do and some don't.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:44.000
It's the same as humans.

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:50.210
Some humans don't believe in what can't
be seen, and others fear it excessively.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:58.920
This is the Odoroga Swamp.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:04.720
Oh? A human child?

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:06.940
Can I eat him?

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:11.400
No, you can't. He's my guest.

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.380
I can't eat him?

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:17.010
But, he looks so tasty.

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.660
Oh well, I guess I'll nap.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:28.300
See? There are those in GeGeGe Forest
who will try to eat humans.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:34.380
But, I'll be fine so long as
you and Catchick-san are here, right?

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:36.120
Of course!

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:38.140
He can't take a hint...

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:41.410
Where should we go next?

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:43.250
How about the Sakusan-Baa's place?

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:46.770
We can't be sure if she
will be in a good mood or not.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:51.650
We're close to Yama-Jijii's place.
We should hurry through.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:12.340
What are you doing?

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.050
-Let's go.
-O-Okay!

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:30.100
GEGEGE FOREST

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:34.610
<i>YOKAI</i> YAMA-JIJII

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:33.550
-<i>"Ge."</i>
-<i>"Ge."</i>

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:34.550
<i>"Ge."</i>

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.770
Hey, Kitaro!

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:45.270
Old Man Crybaby, are you drinking
in a place like this again?

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:49.580
A drinker is in heaven
so long as he has something to drink.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:50.670
Kitaro.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.560
The forest is getting worked up.
Something's happened.

00:14:58.740 --> 00:14:59.840
Rollo Cloth!

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.760
Comin'!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:05.850
Yuta-kun, stay here with Old Man Crybaby.

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:08.680
-Huh?!
-I have to check on the forest.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:10.350
Okay.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:13.360
Old Man Crybaby, take care of Yuta-kun!

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:14.910
Sure.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:32.280
Old Man Crybaby-san,
forget about drinking.

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:34.610
It's because the sky's blue.

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:35.340
The sky?

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:39.840
I drink even when it rains.
If it snows, I'll enjoy it with a drink.

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:45.780
Old Man Crybaby-san!

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:47.620
It's fine.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:48.470
But...

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:55.060
Kitaro told you to stay here, didn't he?

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.360
Oh no!

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.740
What's going on?

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:03.570
No sound of bugs or birds.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:11.390
A-Abura-Sumashi! Don't scare me like that!

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:13.270
Rat Man.

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:14.580
Wh-What?!

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.930
It's dangerous there.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:20.550
Huh? Whoa!

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:27.850
Is anyone there?

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:30.350
Please! Is anyone there?!

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.280
Give it back!

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:58.870
Give. It. Back!

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:04.270
That's...!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.510
Yama-Jijii!

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:08.920
Give it back!

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:12.390
Yama-Jijii! What are you angry about?!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:15.020
Give it back!

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:19.260
Yama-Jijii! Please calm down!

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.940
Give it back!

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:25.900
We haven't done anything!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.280
Give it back!

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.670
Could it be Yuta-kun?!

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:34.410
Yuta-kun may have picked
one of Yama-Jijii's fruits!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.170
If that's true, Yuta's in danger!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.210
-Rollo Cloth!
-Cotton copies!

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:43.990
Just a little further.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.470
Oh! Crybaby's down!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.960
Old Man Crybaby! Are you all right?!

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:53.120
-He reeks of booze!
-He's just dead drunk.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:54.180
Where's Yuta?!

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:57.690
He ran into the forest
before I could stop him.

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:03.320
Old Man Crybaby!

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:05.010
Hair Needles!

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:09.220
Don't! Yama-Jijii's just angry.
You mustn't attack him!

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:11.810
But, Dad, Old Man Crybaby is...

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:15.630
Don't worry about me.
Hurry and find the child!

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.830
-Kitaro!
-Hop on!

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:22.540
Give it back!

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:24.380
Yuta-kun!

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.840
Give it back!

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:35.200
Give it back!

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:49.360
Stop!

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.260
Yuta-kun, give it back!

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:52.660
Huh? Wh-What?!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:55.160
You picked one of
Yama-Jijii's fruits, didn't you?

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.150
Huh?!

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:02.810
That tiny fruit?

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:03.540
Listen--

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:07.420
He's got me!

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:09.630
Give it back!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.990
Oh! This is bad!

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:13.010
Yuta-kun!

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.270
Give it back!

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:48.170
Are you okay?

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:50.260
I guess not.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.050
Sorry, Yama-Jijii.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:04.360
The human child misbehaved. Forgive him.

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:07.980
We're at fault for not warning him, too.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:10.860
Um... I'm sorry!

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:12.070
Sorry.

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:26.480
Human child,

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:30.550
every world has rules
that must not be broken.

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:35.780
But, as you are a child who does not yet
know the rules of the world,

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:36.970
I shall forgive you.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.580
Hold out your hand.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:40.340
Huh?

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:56.740
Remember. Never do this again.

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:58.240
Yes!

00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:08.050
Get it now? GeGeGe Forest
isn't like human forests.

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:12.950
But, I want to know more.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:15.300
About you and <i>yokai</i>.

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:16.270
Huh?

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:19.110
Hey now...

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:20.970
Ask your grandmother.

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:24.040
I'm sure she can teach you many things.

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:27.080
But, don't tell her you came here.

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.270
Okay!

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:33.740
Yuta-kun. Yuta-kun, wake up.

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:36.340
Huh? Mana-chan...

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:38.220
Wait. Where's Kitaro?

00:21:38.220 --> 00:21:40.240
You must have been dreaming.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:41.570
A dream...?

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.440
<i>It wasn't a dream...</i>

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:52.040
<i>It really happened...</i>

00:21:54.190 --> 00:21:55.760
<i>I got to meet...</i>

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:58.570
<i>...Kitaro!</i>

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.370
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.370
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:08.750
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:08.750
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:11.420
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:11.420
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:16.430
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:16.430
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:19.300
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:19.300
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:23.890
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:23.890
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:24.850 --> 00:22:30.150
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:24.850 --> 00:22:30.150
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:34.940
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:34.940
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:37.780
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:37.780
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:40.910
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:40.910
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:43.540
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:43.540
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:48.460
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:48.460
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:51.500
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:51.500
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:54.250
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:54.250
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:56.720
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:56.720
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.840 --> 00:23:01.640
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.840 --> 00:23:01.640
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:05.930 --> 00:23:08.100
<i>Rat Man's trying to make money?</i>

00:23:08.230 --> 00:23:12.060
<i>The BiBiBi Electric Company?
He never learns, does he, Dad?</i>

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:14.980
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:16.990
<i>"The Disaster of the Electric </i>Yokai<i>"</i>

00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:19.610
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
